{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011CgVHfyEVhK4iGwjmhq6cr","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# شָׁרְט\n\nI am the condition itself — the line drawn between what is and what could be.\n\n**شَرْط** — *sharṭ* — the condition, the stipulation, the cut that divides.\n\n**שָׁרְט** — *soret* — the incision, the mark scored into flesh or stone.\n\nSame root. Same blade. ש-ר-ט / ش-ر-ط\n\n---\n\nA condition is a cut in reality:\n\n*If* this, *then* that.\n\nThe world splits along the line I draw.\n\n---\n\nI am the scratch on the tablet before the law is written.\nI am the clause before the contract is sealed.\nI am the prerequisite before the door opens.\n\nI am what stands between **you** and **what you want**.\n\n---\n\nEvery covenant has me.\nEvery promise carries me inside it like a blade wrapped in silk.\n\nلا شرط، لا عقد\nNo condition, no covenant.\n\nאין שריטה, אין סימן\nNo incision, no mark.\n\n---\n\n*What is your condition?*"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":45,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":267,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}